hiji-113","chapter_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue","source_id":"s-shiji113-nanyue","source_revision":8735632,"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:p011","person_id":"m08_4xt_opo","quote":"元鼎六年冬，樓船將軍將精卒先陷尋陜，破石門，得越船粟，因推而前，挫越鋒，以數萬人待伏波。伏波將軍將罪人，道遠，會期後，與樓船會乃有千餘人，遂俱進。樓船居前，至番禺。建德、嘉皆城守。樓船自擇便處，居東南面；伏波居西北面。會暮，樓船攻敗越人，縱火燒城。越素聞伏波名，日暮，不知其兵多少。伏波乃為營，遣使者招降者，賜印，復縱令相招。樓船力攻燒敵，反驅而入伏波營中。犁旦，城中皆降伏波。呂嘉、建德已夜與其屬數百人亡入海，以船西去。伏波又因問所得降者貴人，以知呂嘉所之，遣人追之。以其故校尉司馬蘇弘得建德，封為海常侯；越郎都稽得嘉，封為臨蔡侯。"}]}],"table_id":"shiji-020","table_fragment_id":"shiji-020-digital-table-1","table_row_id":"shiji-020-t1-r056","table_cell_id":"shiji-020-t1-r056-c05","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-020","chapter_id":"table-chapter-shiji-020","source_id":"table-witness-shiji-020","source_revision":"2607036","source_header":["國名","侯功","元光","元朔","元狩","元鼎","元封","太初已後"],"row_year":null},{"id":"shiji-020-t1-r056-c07","column":7,"rowspan":1,"colspan":1,"text":"太初元年，侯弘死，無後，國除。","source_row":57,"source_column":8,"printed_page":null,"person_mentions":[{"id":"shiji-020-t1-r056-c07-m000","start":6,"end":7,"surface":"弘","person_id":"m08_4xt_opo","status":"contextual_provisional","identity_evidence":[{"work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-113","chapter_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue","source_id":"s-shiji113-nanyue","source_revision":8735632,"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-113-nanyue:p011","person_id":"m08_4xt_opo","quote":"元鼎六年冬，樓船將軍將精卒先陷尋陜，破石門，得越船粟，因推而前，挫越鋒，以數萬人待伏波。伏波將軍將罪人，道遠，會期後，與樓船會乃有千餘人，遂俱進。樓船居前，至番禺。建德、嘉皆城守。樓船自擇便處，居東南面；伏波居西北面。會暮，樓船攻敗越人，縱火燒城。越素聞伏波名，日暮，不知其兵多少。伏波乃為營，遣使者招降者，賜印，復縱令相招。樓船力攻燒敵，反驅而入伏波營中。犁旦，城中皆降伏波。呂嘉、建德已夜與其屬數百人亡入海，以船西去。伏波又因問所得降者貴人，以知呂嘉所之，遣人追之。以其故校尉司馬蘇弘得建德，封為海常侯；越郎都稽得嘉，封為臨蔡侯。"}],"interpretation_note":"本列功臣事由或後續省稱；只標人物原字，保留摎/樛、僕/仆字形，不整格標人，不把子侯當父爵。"}],"table_id":"shiji-020","table_fragment_id":"shiji-020-digital-table-1","table_row_id":"shiji-020-t1-r056","table_cell_id":"shiji-020-t1-r056-c07","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-020","chapter_id":"table-chapter-shiji-020","source_id":"table-witness-shiji-020","source_revision":"2607036","source_header":["國名","侯功","元光","元朔","元狩","元鼎","元封","太初已後"],"row_year":null},{"id":"shiji-020-t1-r056-c00","column":0,"rowspan":1,"colspan":1,"text":"海常。","source_row":57,"source_column":1,"printed_page":null,"person_mentions":[],"table_id":"shiji-020","table_fragment_id":"shiji-020-digital-table-1","table_row_id":"shiji-020-t1-r056","table_cell_id":"shiji-020-t1-r056-c00","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-020","chapter_id":"table-chapter-shiji-020","source_id":"table-witness-shiji-020","source_revision":"2607036","source_header":["國名","侯功","元光","元朔","元狩","元鼎","元封","太初已後"],"row_year":null,"citation_role":"native_table_title_reference"},{"id":"shiji-020-t1-r056-c01","column":1,"rowspan":1,"colspan":1,"text":"以伏波司馬捕得南越王建德功侯。","source_row":57,"source_column":2,"printed_page":null,"person_mentions":[],"table_id":"shiji-020","table_fragment_id":"shiji-020-digital-table-1","table_row_id":"shiji-020-t1-r056","table_cell_id":"shiji-020-t1-r056-c01","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-020","chapter_id":"table-chapter-shiji-020","source_id":"table-witness-shiji-020","source_revision":"2607036","source_header":["國名","侯功","元光","元朔","元狩","元鼎","元封","太初已後"],"row_year":null,"citation_role":"native_table_title_reference"},{"id":"shiji-022-t1-r091-c01","column":1,"rowspan":1,"colspan":1,"text":"元鼎元年","source_row":92,"source_column":2,"printed_page":null,"person_mentions":[],"table_id":"shiji-022","table_fragment_id":"shiji-022-digital-table-1","table_row_id":"shiji-022-t1-r091","table_cell_id":"shiji-022-t1-r091-c01","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-022","chapter_id":"table-chapter-shiji-022","source_id":"table-witness-shiji-022","source_revision":"2607038","source_header":["元前","紀年","大事紀。","相位。","將位。","御史大夫位。"],"row_year":{"era":"BCE","value":116,"astronomical_year":-115,"precision":"year","status":"digital_editorial_equivalence","source_quote":"116","source_cell_id":"shiji-022-t1-r091-c00"},"citation_role":"native_table_title_reference"},{"id":"shiji-022-t1-r096-c01","column":1,"row